{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"That's how it is. I think people generally care too much about grades."}],"id":"10de5e98897a2539","jyutping":"gam2 joeng2 laa1。so2 ji5 ngo5 gok3 dak1 e6 jat1 bun1 ge3 jan4 ne1 ngo5 gok3 dak1 zau6 tai2 sing4 zik1 tai2 dak1 taai3 gwo3 gan2 jiu3 lo1。","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"噉樣喇。所以我覺得誒一般嘅人呢我覺得就睇成績睇得太過緊要囖。","words":[{"jyutping":"gam2 joeng2","pos":"c","text":"噉樣"},{"jyutping":"laa1","pos":"y","text":"喇"},{"jyutping":"so2 ji5","pos":"c","text":"所以"},{"jyutping":"ngo5","pos":"r","text":"我"},{"jyutping":"gok3 dak1","pos":"v","text":"覺得"},{"jyutping":"e6","pos":"e","text":"誒"},{"jyutping":"jat1 bun1","pos":"a","text":"一般"},{"jyutping":"ge3","pos":"u","text":"嘅"},{"jyutping":"jan4","pos":"n","text":"人"},{"jyutping":"ne1","pos":"y1","text":"呢"},{"jyutping":"ngo5","pos":"r","text":"我"},{"jyutping":"gok3 dak1","pos":"v","text":"覺得"},{"jyutping":"zau6","pos":"d","text":"就"},{"jyutping":"tai2","pos":"v","text":"睇"},{"jyutping":"sing4 zik1","pos":"n","text":"成績"},{"jyutping":"tai2","pos":"v","text":"睇"},{"jyutping":"dak1","pos":"u","text":"得"},{"jyutping":"taai3 gwo3","pos":"d","text":"太過"},{"jyutping":"gan2 jiu3","pos":"a","text":"緊要"},{"jyutping":"lo1","pos":"y","text":"囖"}]}
